        <body>
            <div xml:id="d352">

                <pb facs="0386" n="310" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg310"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1375</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of Legation Davis to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 12, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to submit herewith a
                    memorandum of the events attending the overthrow of President Vilbrun Guillaume
                    Sam and the happenings immediately thereafter.</p>
                <p>I regret that press of work at the Legation made it impossible for me to prepare
                    this report during the time I was on duty at Port au Prince as Chargé
                    d’Affaires. I have now prepared the same from notes and memoranda made at the
                    time.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. B. Davis, Jr.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d352-a1.xml" xpointer="d352-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
